    {
      "subId": "7111608",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to the Millelith",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "711160801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "711160801": {
            "id": "711160801",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Iron Chuan'er",
            "text": "This trip was really worth it! Not only did we get who we came for, but we also got to meet the famous Traveler.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711160802"
            ]
          },
          "711160802": {
            "id": "711160802",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You know us?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711160803"
            ]
          },
          "711160803": {
            "id": "711160803",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iron Dou'er",
            "text": "Of course. I have relatives in Liyue Harbor, and I've heard all about you, so I recognized you from the get-go.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711160804"
            ]
          },
          "711160804": {
            "id": "711160804",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iron Dou'er",
            "text": "But there were too many ears around, and I didn't want to risk spooking them, so I didn't come clean. Sorry about that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711160805"
            ]
          },
          "711160805": {
            "id": "711160805",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So it wasn't an illegal deal we butted in on, but a bust?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711160806"
            ]
          },
          "711160806": {
            "id": "711160806",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Iron Chuan'er",
            "text": "Correct. We've had our eyes on these smugglers for a while now, but only managed to infiltrate them recently with a bit of timely assistance.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711160807"
            ]
          },
          "711160807": {
            "id": "711160807",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Iron Chuan'er",
            "text": "It's been about a month since then, but today we finally got the opportunity to nab the Iron and Salt Gang and the big Fontainian fish all in one fell swoop.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711160808"
            ]
          },
          "711160808": {
            "id": "711160808",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iron Dou'er",
            "text": "Not to mention the fact that those Fontaine fellows almost wiped us out with their dirty tricks. We were fortunate to have your help, Traveler.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711160809"
            ]
          },
          "711160809": {
            "id": "711160809",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iron Dou'er",
            "text": "Unfortunately, you'll have to take a rain check on the swanky feast we promised. However, we do have some Mora for you. Please, take it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711160810"
            ]
          },
          "711160810": {
            "id": "711160810",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iron Dou'er",
            "text": "And don't even think about saying no. You should be rewarded for helping others. That's the contract we should all uphold. Otherwise, in the future, fewer and fewer people will be willing to extend the hand to those in need.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711160811"
            ]
          },
          "711160811": {
            "id": "711160811",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Iron Chuan'er",
            "text": "Okay, we should probably clean the rest of this up. We won't hold you up any longer.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711160812"
            ]
          },
          "711160812": {
            "id": "711160812",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Iron Chuan'er",
            "text": "Best of luck to you both!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7111651",
